{"seq":2,"slug":"data-collection-and-modeling","title":"数据采集与建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/platform-and-data/data-collection-and-modeling","wordCount":1629,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据采集与建模\">数据采集与建模</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>平台再强大，喂给它的若是脏数据，产出的也只能是垃圾结论——这是我学这部分时记得最牢的一句话。工业数据的采集和建模，干的就是把杂乱的&quot;毛坯数据&quot;加工成干净、有结构、可分析的&quot;数据资产&quot;的活儿。它不性感，却是后面一切分析、AI 应用的地基。</p>\n<p>本节要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据采集要解决&quot;多源异构&quot;问题：来源多、格式杂、协议不一。</li>\n<li>采集来的原始数据通常很脏，需要清洗：去噪、补缺、对齐时间戳、剔除异常。</li>\n<li>数据建模分两类：数据模型（描述数据的结构关系）和机理模型（描述物理规律）。</li>\n<li>工业数据有鲜明特点：时序性强、采样频率高、与物理过程强相关。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><p>我们从&quot;多源异构&quot;这个采集难题说起。一座工厂里，老设备可能只支持 Modbus，新设备用 OPC UA，还有些设备根本没有数字接口、得外挂传感器。数据格式更是五花八门。所以采集层的第一项工作就是&quot;协议转换&quot;和&quot;数据归一化&quot;——把各种方言翻译成统一的语言，给每个数据点打上规范的标签（哪台设备、哪个测点、什么单位、什么时间）。</p>\n<p>采上来的数据往往很脏。常见的问题有：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>噪声：传感器受电磁干扰，读数上下乱跳。</li>\n<li>缺失：某次采集网络抖动，丢了几个点。</li>\n<li>时间不对齐：不同设备的时钟没同步，时间戳对不上。</li>\n<li>异常值：传感器故障导致一个明显不合理的离群读数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>清洗就是处理这些问题。举个简单的例子，对付噪声常用&quot;移动平均&quot;——用一段时间窗口内的平均值代替瞬时值，让曲线变平滑。如果有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个采样点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它们的平均值为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>判断异常值也有简单办法，比如用标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>：偏离均值超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 的点就高度可疑，可以标记或剔除。这类基础统计方法虽简单，却是数据清洗的常备工具。</p>\n<p>清洗干净后，就要建模。这里有两种很不一样的模型，初学者容易混：</p>\n<p>第一种是数据模型，描述数据本身的结构和关系。比如把&quot;工厂—车间—产线—设备—测点&quot;组织成一棵层级树，或者定义&quot;一条生产记录包含哪些字段&quot;。它回答的是&quot;数据长什么样、彼此什么关系&quot;。前一章 OPC UA 的信息模型就是一种数据模型。</p>\n<p>第二种是机理模型，描述物理世界的客观规律。比如电机的发热公式、化学反应的速率方程。它来自工程师几十年的领域知识，回答的是&quot;这个物理过程遵循什么规律&quot;。</p>\n<p>下面这张图展示了从采集到建模的完整加工流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[多源异构设备] --&gt; B[协议转换+归一化]&#10;    B --&gt; C[数据清洗&lt;br/&gt;去噪/补缺/对齐]&#10;    C --&gt; D[数据建模]&#10;    D --&gt; E1[数据模型&lt;br/&gt;结构与关系]&#10;    D --&gt; E2[机理模型&lt;br/&gt;物理规律]&#10;    E1 --&gt; F[数据资产]&#10;    E2 --&gt; F\">flowchart LR\n    A[多源异构设备] --&gt; B[协议转换+归一化]\n    B --&gt; C[数据清洗&lt;br/&gt;去噪/补缺/对齐]\n    C --&gt; D[数据建模]\n    D --&gt; E1[数据模型&lt;br/&gt;结构与关系]\n    D --&gt; E2[机理模型&lt;br/&gt;物理规律]\n    E1 --&gt; F[数据资产]\n    E2 --&gt; F</pre><p>近两年一个重要趋势是&quot;数据驱动 + 机理驱动&quot;的融合：单靠机理模型，遇到复杂工况算不准；单靠数据（AI）模型，缺乏可解释性、也需要海量数据。把两者结合——用机理模型提供物理约束、用数据模型补足复杂性——成了 2026 年工业建模的主流思路，也是后面数字孪生和预测性维护的技术底座。</p>\n<p>最后说说工业数据的特点，理解它你才知道为什么要专门处理。工业数据最突出的是时序性：绝大多数是带时间戳的连续读数（温度、压力、电流随时间变化），所以工业平台普遍使用时序数据库（TSDB）来高效存储。它采样频率高、数据量大，还与物理过程强相关——一个异常读数背后往往对应一个真实的物理事件，不能随便丢弃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>解释&quot;多源异构&quot;指的是什么。为什么采集层第一件事往往是&quot;协议转换和归一化&quot;？</li>\n<li>移动平均的公式是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。请你算一算：若连续 5 次温度读数为 70、72、71、95、73（其中 95 疑似噪声），这 5 个点的平均值是多少？你觉得直接用平均值合适吗，为什么？</li>\n<li>用你自己的话区分&quot;数据模型&quot;和&quot;机理模型&quot;，各举一个例子。</li>\n<li>思考题：文中说工业数据&quot;异常读数背后往往对应真实物理事件，不能随便丢弃&quot;。请举一个例子说明：在什么情况下，一个看似异常的离群值其实是极有价值的信号？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>想动手体验数据清洗，我推荐你找一份公开的传感器时序数据集（比如某设备的振动或温度数据），用 Excel 或任意工具画出曲线，亲手识别其中的噪声、缺失和异常点，再试着用移动平均把它平滑——这种练习对建立&quot;数据感&quot;非常有效。</p>\n<p>理论上，可以了解一下&quot;时序数据库（如 InfluxDB、TDengine）&quot;为什么比传统关系型数据库更适合工业场景。另外，&quot;数字主线（Digital Thread）&quot;是个值得提前接触的概念，它强调把产品全生命周期的数据串成一条连贯的线，和这一节的数据建模一脉相承，也为下一节的数字孪生做了铺垫。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节我们走进了平台的&quot;原料加工车间&quot;：采集要克服多源异构、做协议转换与归一化；清洗要去噪、补缺、对齐、剔异常；建模则分为描述结构关系的数据模型和描述物理规律的机理模型，而二者的融合正是 2026 年的主流方向。我们也认识了工业数据时序性强、采样频率高、与物理过程强相关的特点。</p>\n<p>数据被加工成干净、有结构、有规律的资产后，就能用来做一件很酷的事——在虚拟世界里给真实设备造一个会同步、能预测的&quot;数字分身&quot;。下一节，我们就来认识数字孪生。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据采集与建模","id":"数据采集与建模"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工业互联网平台","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/platform-and-data/industrial-internet-platform"},"next":{"title":"数字孪生","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/platform-and-data/digital-twin"}}